## Reading

Authorship and review stay **extreme**. Merge Gini is computed on the small merger set, so the more honest headline is **top-3 share** (still ~80%+). Inequality did not wash out after 2021; the names at the top changed (laanwj → fanquake) more than the shape of the distribution.

Gini here is GitHub-only. Informal channels redistribute *talk*, not merge keys. See `CROSS_PLATFORM_NETWORKS.md`.

